Dialogue: 99,0:00:34.79,0:00:37.99,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,It feels great! Come on down!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:38.86,0:00:41.01,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Go on, she's calling you.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:41.01,0:00:42.03,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,No she's not.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:42.05,0:00:43.23,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Yes, she is.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.21,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,See? She's looking at you.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:45.21,0:00:47.16,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Buzz off, will you?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:50.79,0:00:53.08,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Aw, he beat you to the punch.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:53.08,0:00:55.21,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:55.21,0:00:56.65,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,This is dumb.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:56.65,0:00:57.35,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:57.35,0:01:00.84,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,This is only fun for people whose sense of danger is dulled.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:01.47,0:01:04.60,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,It's not as though anything changes once you jump.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:05.19,0:01:07.10,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is the sort of thing that I—
Dialogue: 99,0:01:06.71,0:01:08.45,Alt Styling,Ace,0,0,0,,Just jump already!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:11.75,0:01:12.44,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:12.73,0:01:13.55,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,For the love of...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:13.55,0:01:14.23,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:14.23,0:01:15.31,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,No, this is gonna be bad.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:31.67,0:01:32.31,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:32.31,0:01:33.62,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:33.62,0:01:36.61,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,That was our world, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:36.61,0:01:37.88,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Then did we just go home?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:42.21,0:01:45.39,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,You're amazing, you know that?\N Your talents can achieve anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:45.39,0:01:46.89,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I wouldn't go that far.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:47.39,0:01:49.31,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,This just comes in handy, is all—
Dialogue: 99,0:01:49.31,0:01:51.39,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,it's not the kind of power that changes the world.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:51.97,0:01:53.02,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Don't you think?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:54.23,0:01:57.21,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Still, this world's so unfair, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:57.21,0:02:00.73,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,There's someone on this island who doesn't need to compensate the others.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:00.73,0:02:05.05,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,There are definitely those in the world\N who are chosen to get special treatment.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:05.85,0:02:07.25,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,How's the plan coming along?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:07.25,0:02:09.41,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:09.41,0:02:14.03,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Things are starting to come together,\N but some key elements still remain unclear.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:14.03,0:02:14.92,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:15.61,0:02:18.92,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Someone will eventually show up to save us.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:23.37,0:02:25.25,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Mm, this is good!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:25.25,0:02:27.25,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Too spicy. Hey, pass the water.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:27.25,0:02:28.05,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:28.33,0:02:31.01,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,we could probably get back home with his power, couldn't we?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:31.01,0:02:33.18,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,We made it home earlier for a moment.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:33.61,0:02:36.31,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,But I'm not even sure if it is my power.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:36.31,0:02:39.06,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Why not? You gotta take responsibility for your actions.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:39.06,0:02:42.65,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,You did that thing, didn't you? What do you call it, warping?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:44.49,0:02:47.45,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Even Rajdhani says so. Go on, do it.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:48.35,0:02:50.41,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I really don't know if it was me.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:50.41,0:02:53.13,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,It doesn't feel like I did anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:53.13,0:02:57.79,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Ugh, man, you really are useless.\N You're seriously dragging everyone down.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:57.79,0:02:59.77,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Pull it together, asshole.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:02.33,0:03:05.31,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Then again, was that really {\i1}our {\i0}world?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:05.31,0:03:07.01,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Hmm, I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:07.41,0:03:09.85,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,It wasn't actually the "light," for the record.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:10.61,0:03:12.64,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Should we have Rajdhani look into it tomorrow?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:14.25,0:03:15.14,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,That monkey...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:16.23,0:03:17.39,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Special delivery!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:17.79,0:03:19.65,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Hey, having dinner together?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:31.51,0:03:33.29,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,He's still pissed.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:33.67,0:03:37.54,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,I said I was sorry, but he just can't seem to let it go.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.19,0:03:39.54,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Such a child.{I'd probably still be pissed if someone hit me with a baseball bat. - L}
Dialogue: 99,0:03:41.93,0:03:44.65,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Is carrying that stuff here your job?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:44.65,0:03:47.30,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Just use your power. What is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:47.65,0:03:51.47,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Oh, it's not some fancy kind of power.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:51.47,0:03:54.33,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Yeah... I'd rather not say what it is.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:54.33,0:03:55.31,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Oh hey, Nagara,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:55.61,0:03:58.25,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,wanna play a little baseball together again sometime?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:58.25,0:04:00.77,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's this coming from?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:00.77,0:04:03.51,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,I have to practice once in a while, or I'll get rusty.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:03.51,0:04:05.19,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Come on, join me.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:05.19,0:04:07.81,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Wow, this is a surprise. You were in the baseball club?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:07.81,0:04:09.15,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I don't remember.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:09.15,0:04:11.95,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Are you for real? I'll never forget it!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:11.95,0:04:13.31,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,During our last{ little league} tournament,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:13.31,0:04:15.97,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,your three consecutive errors cost us the game!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:15.97,0:04:17.75,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I-Is that right?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:17.75,0:04:20.21,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,If it weren't for that, we could have gone to Nationals!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:22.46,0:04:24.49,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Hey, you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:25.99,0:04:29.09,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Ace is around, right?\N Why don't you play with him?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:29.09,0:04:32.71,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,No can do. You know how much he hates to practice.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:32.71,0:04:35.93,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Besides, lately he's been too busy with his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:35.93,0:04:37.47,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, {\i1}her{\i0}.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:38.13,0:04:40.73,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Must be nice to be popular.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:41.11,0:04:44.09,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Hey, any of you heard what Ace's power is?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:44.09,0:04:45.35,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,I haven't.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:45.35,0:04:46.19,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:46.19,0:04:48.25,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Apparently it's "Sweetwater."
Dialogue: 99,0:04:48.25,0:04:49.77,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Huh? What does that do?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:49.77,0:04:50.99,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Exactly that.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:50.99,0:04:54.04,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Supposedly, he can make any water drinkable.{This girl is severely underestimating the severity of a looming water crisis}
Dialogue: 99,0:04:54.04,0:04:55.45,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,What a riot!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:55.45,0:05:00.25,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,For all that big talk, he gets to drink muddy water and say it's yummy.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:00.57,0:05:04.38,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Say, if you're asking for baseball practice,\N does that mean you have a place where you can play?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:04.77,0:05:08.37,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact,\N I made a baseball diamond not far from here.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:08.37,0:05:09.85,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Whoa, did you?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:09.85,0:05:10.83,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:10.83,0:05:12.01,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:20.64,0:05:23.14,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that, monkeys?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:27.91,0:05:29.73,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,That was awesome, transfer kid!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:29.73,0:05:30.15,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:30.43,0:05:33.24,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Nobody's beaten the Rock Monster since Steroid!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:33.53,0:05:34.99,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Huh? Who's that?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:34.99,0:05:36.93,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Steroid Monkey!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:36.93,0:05:39.74,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Eight-time record-setter for\N home runs in the Monkey League!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:40.09,0:05:42.12,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Wait, what's the Monkey League?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:42.12,0:05:44.59,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Huh? You don't know?!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:44.59,0:05:50.26,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Oh, right, you can't see them, huh? Sorry 'bout that.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:52.53,0:05:54.01,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The Monkey League—
Dialogue: 99,0:05:54.39,0:05:57.27,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,It's a baseball league here in the world of Monkey Mountain,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:57.27,0:06:00.64,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,played by the great monkeys,\N which started when the first ball and bat
Dialogue: 99,0:06:00.64,0:06:04.14,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,and the rules of the game were handed down to them.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:04.71,0:06:10.25,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}In the Monkey League, a number of great players arose from among the nameless masses,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:10.25,0:06:12.71,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}who all bore the same appearances.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:12.71,0:06:14.67,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}The legendary home run king,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:14.67,0:06:19.89,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}who hit an unprecedented, record-breaking 80 home runs in one year, Steroid Monkey!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:19.89,0:06:23.07,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}Toppling the god of batting,\N Monkey River's career batting average
Dialogue: 99,0:06:23.07,0:06:27.59,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}by two thousandths,\N the miracle hitting machine, Upper Monkey!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:27.59,0:06:31.09,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}The greatest catcher of the Bigfoot era, Mister Monkey,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:31.09,0:06:34.91,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}who as a manager would go on to break the record for most league wins,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:34.91,0:06:37.43,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}with a legendary ten-season-long streak!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:37.43,0:06:40.43,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Then came the golden age of the M-League.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:40.43,0:06:44.13,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,A miracle monkey came along and dethroned those previous legends one by one.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:44.13,0:06:46.65,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The monster, Monkey Blue!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:46.65,0:06:49.49,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,This maverick of the league was the only one with blue hair,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:49.49,0:06:52.59,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,who, despite weathering ugly\N discrimination and crafty persecution,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:52.59,0:06:56.33,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,triumphed with overwhelming talent,\N to ultimately become a hero,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:56.33,0:06:58.95,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,and a symbol of hope for the monkeys!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:59.39,0:07:02.47,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Despite being a rookie,\N Blue put the brakes to the king, Steroid Monkey!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:02.47,0:07:05.29,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Breaking his bat along with his heart,\N Blue drove him to retirement.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:05.29,0:07:09.27,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Then, with his mighty pitching arm, Blue led his underdog team Monkey and Club to victory,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:09.27,0:07:12.07,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,preventing Bigfoot's championship streak from reaching 11.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:12.07,0:07:14.29,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The public accepted this new hair color,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:14.29,0:07:16.15,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,and there was no doubt in anybody's mind
Dialogue: 99,0:07:16.15,0:07:17.93,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,that the era of Monkey Blue had begun!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:17.93,0:07:18.97,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:19.25,0:07:22.69,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,a great tragedy shook the sport,\N when a near-perfect game was foiled,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:22.69,0:07:25.35,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,and a monkey was killed in the diamond!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:25.35,0:07:27.81,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,I wanna see them! I wanna see the monkeys!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:27.81,0:07:29.48,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Huh? {\i1}That's{\i0} your takeaway?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:29.48,0:07:31.13,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,I want to see the monkeys, too!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:31.13,0:07:33.82,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,I know, right? Monkeys! Monkeys! I want my own pet monkey!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.15,0:07:35.82,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Where can we see them?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:37.41,0:07:38.32,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:38.63,0:07:40.11,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Huh? Where?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:40.11,0:07:41.59,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Like I said, here.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:41.59,0:07:43.41,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Uh, {\i1}here{\i0}?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:43.41,0:07:45.47,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Yeah. Right here.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:45.47,0:07:48.69,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,But it's not like you can just wait around and see them.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:48.69,0:07:51.33,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,You need to use a certain piece of gear.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:51.65,0:07:52.53,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Gear?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:52.53,0:07:53.84,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,What kind of gear?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:54.35,0:07:55.84,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Oh, the monkeys?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:55.84,0:07:59.72,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,That's right. You have to use one of these to see the monkeys.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:00.37,0:08:02.60,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,A Monkey Getter. Wanna borrow it?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:04.27,0:08:04.85,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:04.27,0:08:04.85,Alt Styling,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:05.15,0:08:07.85,Default,Shanghai,0,0,0,,[No! No way in hell!]
Dialogue: 99,0:08:10.41,0:08:12.98,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Hey, if money's the problem, I got you covered. See?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:13.31,0:08:16.61,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,It's not about the money. She just doesn't like you.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:16.61,0:08:21.11,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Damn her. If we had that thing,\N we could see the monkeys!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:21.11,0:08:25.05,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,What do we do? Steal it?\N Threaten them? Beat them? Trick them?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:25.05,0:08:26.33,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:26.33,0:08:27.79,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,So what do we do?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:27.79,0:08:31.25,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Hey, how do you all even know about the monkeys in the first place?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:31.87,0:08:35.85,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,We were helping Cap with some baseball practice,\N and he told us about them.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:35.85,0:08:36.67,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:36.67,0:08:37.71,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:37.71,0:08:39.61,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Can you really see monkeys with that thing?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:39.61,0:08:41.63,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Huh? You don't believe me?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:41.63,0:08:44.53,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,N-No, it's not that.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:44.53,0:08:48.83,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,I get what you mean, though.\N It just looks like a regular flashlight, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:48.83,0:08:53.75,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,But if you shine it on yourself like this,\N you become able to see the monkeys.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:53.75,0:08:56.67,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Or maybe more precisely,\N the world where the monkeys live.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:56.67,0:08:57.99,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:57.99,0:09:00.73,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Then again, Nagara, for you, why not?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:00.73,0:09:03.32,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Yeah, for old time's sake, as former teammates.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:03.69,0:09:04.82,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,You'll lend it to him?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:06.35,0:09:09.61,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,How does this sound?\N You've already got some practice in.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:09.61,0:09:12.96,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Play against me, and if you win, I'll let you borrow it.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:14.21,0:09:15.21,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,A one-inning game.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:15.77,0:09:20.05,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,If any of you get a hit off one of my pitches, you win.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:20.05,0:09:20.84,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:20.84,0:09:22.01,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:22.01,0:09:23.37,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,We'll play your game!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:24.09,0:09:26.10,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Heh, that's more like it.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:26.71,0:09:30.10,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,But I'm not playing for nothing.\N I want something in return.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:30.67,0:09:32.45,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,If {\i1}you{\i0} lose...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:36.77,0:09:38.98,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey, I don't know about that...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:38.98,0:09:40.99,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,It's settled!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:45.53,0:09:46.87,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Come on, you're not even close!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:47.33,0:09:49.37,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Stop dropping your elbow! Keep your head up!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:54.13,0:09:55.91,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I've got no hope of hitting against him.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:55.91,0:09:57.75,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Well, you could be right.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:57.75,0:10:00.00,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Is Ace really that good?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:00.31,0:10:04.38,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's a prodigy.\N He's already had pros come asking about him.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:04.38,0:10:06.47,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? That is good.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:06.47,0:10:09.55,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Hey! What good is it if you're beaten before you even play?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:09.55,0:10:13.01,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Play to win! If you don't believe in yourself, who will?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:17.33,0:10:19.73,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I've never counted on myself for anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:22.27,0:10:23.11,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:24.47,0:10:27.31,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Well, you never know what's going to happen during a game.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:27.31,0:10:29.37,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Hope for a miracle and do your best.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:30.67,0:10:33.45,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,By the way, what was his condition for doing this?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:33.45,0:10:35.85,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing that important.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:38.23,0:10:41.63,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,You're not playing baseball with them?\N They'd have it in the bag with you there.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:41.63,0:10:43.63,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in seeing monkeys.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:43.63,0:10:45.51,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Plus that oaf is there.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:45.51,0:10:49.51,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I'm terribly curious about this\N mysterious flashlight, the Monkey Getter.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:50.03,0:10:54.02,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,If something like that exists,\N it could change my whole view of the world!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:54.51,0:10:58.21,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Makes no difference to me.\N Once Nagara masters his power,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:58.21,0:10:59.97,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,we'll be home in no time.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:01.15,0:11:03.78,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I don't think it's quite that simple.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:05.78,0:11:09.49,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,That year had been Blue's greatest season.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:09.49,0:11:11.73,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Every game, he pitched the full nine innings and won.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:11.73,0:11:15.91,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,With a league-high 32 wins posted,\N the team won its second consecutive title.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:15.91,0:11:17.97,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Then, in the final game of the season,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:17.97,0:11:22.05,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Blue was closing in on pitching an absolutely perfect game!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:22.57,0:11:23.71,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,It was 16-0,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:23.71,0:11:27.01,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,with Monkey and Club commanding a huge lead going into the final inning.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:27.01,0:11:31.63,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Bottom of the 9th, two outs.\N Blue had struck out 26 batters on 80 pitches,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:31.63,0:11:34.73,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,and had gotten the last batter two strikes down in quick order!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:34.73,0:11:40.17,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The overflowing stadium was blanketed in electricity,\N waiting for the call of that last pitch to ring out!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:40.17,0:11:45.23,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,All of the monkeys there focused their intense gaze on Blue's every move!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:45.23,0:11:49.70,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,None of them had any doubt that this would be an absolutely perfect game!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:49.70,0:11:52.79,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Yes, there was indeed an uneasy foreboding.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:52.79,0:11:56.69,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,In hindsight, it was clear.\N One monkey, unaccustomed to that pressure—
Dialogue: 99,0:11:56.69,0:11:58.25,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,the peculiar umpire...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:58.86,0:12:01.25,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Then, the world went off-kilter.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:01.25,0:12:04.67,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The 81st pitch! Out of respect for Blue's honor,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:04.67,0:12:06.77,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,I will say that it was by no means a careless pitch.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:06.77,0:12:08.51,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The world itself had slipped!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:08.79,0:12:11.83,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,No, there is no possibility that I'm being partial to Blue!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:11.83,0:12:13.39,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,It actually happened!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:13.39,0:12:18.03,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The world itself moved just a little bit! It's the truth!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:20.19,0:12:23.55,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The ball looked like it may have slightly missed the strike zone,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:23.55,0:12:26.15,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,but could be called as either a strike or a ball!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:26.15,0:12:29.17,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,And the umpire making the call was the one monkey in that stadium—
Dialogue: 99,0:12:29.17,0:12:32.95,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,in that whole world—who did slip with the world!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:38.57,0:12:40.59,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The crowd rose to their feet en masse!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:40.59,0:12:42.15,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,They started tearing out their hair,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:42.15,0:12:44.03,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,and stamping their feet with all their might!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:44.03,0:12:46.37,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,They broke out in boos! Tremendous booing!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:46.37,0:12:48.92,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The umpire firmly refused requests to check the video replay.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:49.25,0:12:51.69,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Blue was visibly dissatisfied, and charged the umpire!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:51.69,0:12:52.93,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,"That was a strike!"
Dialogue: 99,0:12:53.57,0:12:55.57,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The umpire quietly shook his head.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:55.57,0:12:56.79,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,"Hey, are you nuts?!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:56.79,0:13:00.13,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,That pitch would have sealed an absolutely perfect game!"
Dialogue: 99,0:13:00.13,0:13:02.77,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The umpire firmly replied, "I am aware."
Dialogue: 99,0:13:02.77,0:13:06.63,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,"No, you don't get it!\N Why didn't you call that ball a strike?!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:06.63,0:13:08.77,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The outcome of the game is already decided!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:08.77,0:13:12.51,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,On top of that, this game is a throwaway anyhow!\N The batter is dispirited!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:12.51,0:13:16.29,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,So how come, when it didn't matter if you called that pitch a strike or a ball,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:16.29,0:13:19.91,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,did you not call it a strike?! What was the point of that?!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:19.91,0:13:23.99,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Moreover, do you not hear the cheers of hope and anticipation from the crowd?!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:23.99,0:13:27.96,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,You know that this isn't the outcome they wanted!"
Dialogue: 99,0:13:28.33,0:13:30.47,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,"I am aware of that, as well."
Dialogue: 99,0:13:31.45,0:13:32.88,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,So, why did he?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:33.23,0:13:36.89,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,"The hopes of the crowd have no bearing on this game.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:36.89,0:13:39.59,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,There is a stadium here, and inside it, there are rules.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:39.59,0:13:42.89,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,No matter what the reasons may be, things should remain fair in here."
Dialogue: 99,0:13:44.09,0:13:45.15,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,"You're wrong!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:45.43,0:13:50.03,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,This is a baseball show!\N Everyone is pinning their hopes and dreams on me!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:50.03,0:13:53.09,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,I'm carrying the weight of the whole Monkey League!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:53.09,0:13:55.41,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Right now, as far as this place goes, {\i1}I{\i0} am the rules!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:56.49,0:13:58.21,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Now, reverse your decision!"
Dialogue: 99,0:13:58.21,0:14:01.09,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Blue's huge hands were trembling.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:01.09,0:14:02.66,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,"I cannot do that."
Dialogue: 99,0:14:03.23,0:14:05.25,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The umpire was utterly unflinching.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:05.25,0:14:08.42,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,"Right now, as far as this place is concerned, {\i1}I{\i0} am the rules."
Dialogue: 99,0:14:09.99,0:14:13.80,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Blue knew the truth as well.\N The replay was shown on the big screen.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:14.55,0:14:17.01,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The fact was, due to the world slipping,
Dialogue: 99,0:14:17.01,0:14:20.81,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,the ball had missed the strike zone by no more than a micron!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:20.81,0:14:24.81,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,But Blue could not accept that decision.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:25.27,0:14:28.47,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,When play resumed,\N Blue threw the ball at the exact same speed,
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.47,0:14:33.15,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,on the exact same course as that 81st pitch,\N three more times.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:33.15,0:14:34.82,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,"Ball four!"
Dialogue: 99,0:14:35.23,0:14:38.05,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Spiking his glove into the mound, Blue walked off the game.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:38.05,0:14:41.25,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,This incited the stirred-up spectators to begin rioting!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:41.25,0:14:45.33,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,As the crowd rushed onto the field, they all charged at the umpire!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:46.35,0:14:49.69,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,As the terrified batter looked on,\N the umpire had his head beaten in,
Dialogue: 99,0:14:49.69,0:14:53.09,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,and the rioting crowd tore him apart.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:53.09,0:14:56.67,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,His thin, scruffy body had its flesh and blood trodden on,
Dialogue: 99,0:14:56.67,0:14:59.71,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,spat upon, dishonored, and breathed its last.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:04.39,0:15:06.35,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,The monkey died.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:06.71,0:15:08.39,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,All over a game of baseball.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:09.11,0:15:13.07,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Blue had taken on all of their hopes for that one pitch.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:13.07,0:15:14.59,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,What an amazing monkey.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:14.59,0:15:17.86,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,That's for sure. Blue was the best pitcher ever.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:17.86,0:15:19.74,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,No, I meant the umpire.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:20.05,0:15:20.85,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:22.75,0:15:25.12,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,He prevailed against the whole world.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:25.43,0:15:27.01,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,You're making too much of it.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:27.01,0:15:29.15,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Nagara, don't you feel anything?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:30.13,0:15:32.00,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Don't you feel angry?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:35.99,0:15:37.25,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:44.41,0:15:47.35,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Strike! Batter out!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:49.10,0:15:51.73,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,It makes sense that that monkey got killed.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:52.57,0:15:54.72,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,A world where the ordinary kill the genius,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:54.72,0:15:57.74,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,or where ignorant fools destroy talent is...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:59.95,0:16:01.49,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Foul!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:04.13,0:16:06.65,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,{\i1}With that rugged, yet beautiful form,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:06.65,0:16:09.75,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,{\i1}she'll never even see my lightning fastball.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:11.39,0:16:13.63,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Strike two!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:16.93,0:16:19.34,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Strike! Batter out!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:22.19,0:16:23.33,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:27.75,0:16:29.33,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:37.49,0:16:39.55,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Strike two!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:41.55,0:16:44.12,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,So, how do you like my pitching?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:44.55,0:16:48.43,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're really good.\N I doubt there's any way I can hit that.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:48.43,0:16:50.12,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,You just don't feel like hitting.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:51.03,0:16:52.33,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,There's no way I could.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:58.99,0:17:00.61,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Why am I not...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:02.53,0:17:04.09,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,B-Ball!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:04.09,0:17:05.75,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Hey, watch out!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:05.75,0:17:08.87,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah! That was a beanball! Eject him!{I'm so glad this TL knows baseball. - L}
Dialogue: 99,0:17:08.87,0:17:10.31,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,He is so lame!{TLC}{Huh?}{Can be read as "damn he's bad" too tbh}
Dialogue: 99,0:17:10.31,0:17:11.98,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,He is handsome, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:11.98,0:17:13.27,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Hey, you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:13.27,0:17:16.48,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,I'm the one who gave baseball to the monkeys.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:19.63,0:17:21.24,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,I am special.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:22.83,0:17:24.35,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,If you lose,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:24.35,0:17:27.89,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,then you return us to our world as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:27.89,0:17:32.50,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,You can't tell me you can't do it, either.\N I heard. You're our "savior", right?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:33.11,0:17:35.67,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh? No, I'm not—
Dialogue: 99,0:17:35.67,0:17:38.69,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Just looking at you now makes me want to puke.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:38.69,0:17:41.35,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,I can't believe someone like you got chosen.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:43.13,0:17:45.31,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,This world is all messed up.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:45.31,0:17:48.57,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Put us back in the world where I am properly appreciated.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:48.57,0:17:50.99,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,That's what your power is for.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:51.89,0:17:53.52,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:53.99,0:17:56.40,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Do it. Even if it kills you.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:58.75,0:18:01.15,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh? A m-monkey?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:03.19,0:18:05.03,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,A one-armed monkey...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:06.17,0:18:10.04,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,How did you know he had one arm?\N Can you see the umpire?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:21.39,0:18:25.75,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,The truth is, you wanted to be a baseball player, too, didn't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:25.75,0:18:27.81,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,But you couldn't.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:29.11,0:18:33.89,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Still, you were drawn to the sometimes cruel fairness of baseball,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:33.89,0:18:35.55,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,and became an umpire.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:38.01,0:18:41.59,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,You were watching over the game from there, this whole time.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:43.83,0:18:46.17,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,It wasn't the umpire that got killed...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:46.17,0:18:46.91,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:46.91,0:18:48.79,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,It was baseball!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:48.79,0:18:50.17,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you talking—
Dialogue: 99,0:18:50.17,0:18:51.37,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I saw it myself.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:52.13,0:18:55.37,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,So he {\i1}can{\i0} do it.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:56.43,0:18:57.51,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,You scum.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:57.51,0:18:58.88,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Don't get so full of yourself.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:00.13,0:19:01.38,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:04.13,0:19:05.38,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:09.39,0:19:11.89,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Strike! Batter out!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:11.89,0:19:14.02,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Ah, you idiot!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:16.27,0:19:17.73,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,That was awesome, Nagara!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:17.73,0:19:18.97,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,I underestimated you.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:18.97,0:19:22.31,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Too bad. But that was a nice swing.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:22.31,0:19:22.98,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:23.27,0:19:26.11,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Aw, we don't get to see any monkeys.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:26.11,0:19:26.97,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:26.97,0:19:28.05,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:28.05,0:19:30.45,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Huh? You've got something stuck to you.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:30.91,0:19:32.05,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:32.05,0:19:33.20,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:33.20,0:19:34.65,Overlap,Mizuho,0,0,0,,{\an8}That didn't come from my cats.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:34.65,0:19:35.87,Overlap,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}Is it some kind of fur?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:35.87,0:19:37.41,Overlap,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}When did it get stuck to you?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:37.49,0:19:39.46,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,You're here to cheer me up?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:39.91,0:19:42.19,Default,Shanghai,0,0,0,,[This isn't where we're supposed to be.]
Dialogue: 99,0:19:43.43,0:19:46.22,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,I guess today's the last day of life on the island.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:46.22,0:19:47.99,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,I'm going to miss it.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:47.99,0:19:49.71,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:50.23,0:19:55.07,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Actually, I've been thinking of quitting baseball for a while now.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:55.60,0:20:01.23,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Nobody knows better than me that\N I lack the talent to play in the big leagues.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:01.59,0:20:06.59,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Still, we played for the fun of it a long time ago. Just like monkeys.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:06.59,0:20:10.83,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,But before we knew it,\N it became about whether or not we had the talent,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:10.83,0:20:12.57,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,or how it would get us into college,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:12.57,0:20:16.03,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,and that started taking up all our attention.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.65,0:20:21.63,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,But then, watching those monkeys playing,\N I couldn't sit still.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:22.11,0:20:25.91,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}I don't know how to say it, but it was kind of like...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:25.91,0:20:29.15,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}I felt like, "I wanna play baseball!"
Dialogue: 99,0:20:29.15,0:20:33.29,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}And once I realized that, here it was—\Nthe diamond was already in place.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:33.29,0:20:35.89,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}Strange, isn't it? I don't have the talent for baseball,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:35.89,0:20:38.51,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}but it's all I ever think about.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:40.65,0:20:42.07,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's not so strange.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:43.13,0:20:44.61,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,It's not?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:44.61,0:20:46.07,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:52.41,0:20:53.74,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:53.74,0:20:55.97,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Does the plan seem like it's going to work?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:55.97,0:20:58.89,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Who knows? But it sure is an amazing power.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:58.89,0:21:00.43,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,We can go anywhere.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:00.43,0:21:03.59,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Really? It doesn't look that way to me...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:03.59,0:21:04.63,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,She's not lying...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:04.63,0:21:08.27,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,but it also may not be exactly what everyone is thinking, either.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:09.49,0:21:13.13,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Nagara has reached the point where he can control his warp power.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:13.13,0:21:15.26,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,We can say goodbye to this place now.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:15.61,0:21:18.04,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go home to our own world!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:20.85,0:21:22.47,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Go on, do it.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:22.97,0:21:24.79,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:32.03,0:21:33.66,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Huh? Where are we?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:33.66,0:21:35.89,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Oh, this isn't right.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:38.11,0:21:39.67,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,This isn't it, either.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:51.19,0:21:52.85,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Where's the school, already?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:52.85,0:21:54.71,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,How long until we get there?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:54.71,0:21:56.53,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,That's enough showing off.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:56.53,0:21:58.47,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:59.67,0:22:00.93,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I can't go back.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:00.93,0:22:01.99,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:01.99,0:22:04.19,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Not just to our world.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:04.19,0:22:06.94,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I can't go where I want to.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:08.53,0:22:10.44,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,That guy really is worthless.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:10.44,0:22:12.44,Overlap,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}Aww, are you serious?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:10.44,0:22:13.21,Alt Overlap,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}Well, that sucked.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:12.44,0:22:14.45,Overlap,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's about what I figured.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:13.21,0:22:14.45,Alt Overlap,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's our fault for expecting anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:14.45,0:22:16.81,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,That pretty well clears that up.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:16.81,0:22:20.83,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Nagara has the power to move to other worlds.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:21.31,0:22:23.45,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,But he can't choose where he goes.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:23.45,0:22:28.31,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,I mean, I can't believe this world we've been in is one that he would choose.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:30.43,0:22:33.22,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Hey, look over there.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:36.21,0:22:39.05,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Huh? M-Ms. Aki?!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:39.72,0:22:40.59,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,A teacher?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:40.59,0:22:43.23,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Someone else besides us got cast away?!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:42.11,0:22:43.23,Alt Styling,Classmates,0,0,0,,She's here to save us!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:43.23,0:22:45.69,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Shut up, you worms!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:56.23,0:22:58.61,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Playtime's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.79,0:00:37.99,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,It feels great! Come on down!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:41.01,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Go on, she's calling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.01,0:00:42.03,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,No she's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.05,0:00:43.23,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Yes, she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.21,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,See? She's looking at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.21,0:00:47.16,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Buzz off, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.79,0:00:53.08,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Aw, he beat you to the punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.08,0:00:55.21,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.21,0:00:56.65,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,This is dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.65,0:00:57.35,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.35,0:01:00.84,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,This is only fun for people whose sense of danger is dulled.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.47,0:01:04.60,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,It's not as though anything changes once you jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.19,0:01:07.10,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is the sort of thing that I—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.71,0:01:08.45,Alt Styling,Ace,0,0,0,,Just jump already!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.75,0:01:12.44,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.73,0:01:13.55,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,For the love of...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.55,0:01:14.23,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.23,0:01:15.31,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,No, this is gonna be bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.67,0:01:32.31,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.31,0:01:33.62,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.62,0:01:36.61,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,That was our world, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.61,0:01:37.88,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Then did we just go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.21,0:01:45.39,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,You're amazing, you know that?\N Your talents can achieve anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.39,0:01:46.89,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I wouldn't go that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.39,0:01:49.31,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,This just comes in handy, is all—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.31,0:01:51.39,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,it's not the kind of power that changes the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.97,0:01:53.02,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.23,0:01:57.21,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Still, this world's so unfair, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.21,0:02:00.73,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,There's someone on this island who doesn't need to compensate the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.73,0:02:05.05,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,There are definitely those in the world\N who are chosen to get special treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.85,0:02:07.25,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,How's the plan coming along?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.25,0:02:09.41,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.41,0:02:14.03,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Things are starting to come together,\N but some key elements still remain unclear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.03,0:02:14.92,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.61,0:02:18.92,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Someone will eventually show up to save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.37,0:02:25.25,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Mm, this is good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.25,0:02:27.25,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Too spicy. Hey, pass the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.25,0:02:28.05,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.33,0:02:31.01,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,we could probably get back home with his power, couldn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.01,0:02:33.18,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,We made it home earlier for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.61,0:02:36.31,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,But I'm not even sure if it is my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.31,0:02:39.06,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Why not? You gotta take responsibility for your actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.06,0:02:42.65,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,You did that thing, didn't you? What do you call it, warping?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.49,0:02:47.45,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Even Rajdhani says so. Go on, do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.35,0:02:50.41,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I really don't know if it was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.41,0:02:53.13,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,It doesn't feel like I did anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.13,0:02:57.79,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Ugh, man, you really are useless.\N You're seriously dragging everyone down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.79,0:02:59.77,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Pull it together, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.33,0:03:05.31,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Then again, was that really {\i1}our {\i0}world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.31,0:03:07.01,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Hmm, I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.41,0:03:09.85,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,It wasn't actually the "light," for the record.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.61,0:03:12.64,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Should we have Rajdhani look into it tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.25,0:03:15.14,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,That monkey...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.23,0:03:17.39,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Special delivery!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.79,0:03:19.65,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Hey, having dinner together?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.51,0:03:33.29,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,He's still pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.67,0:03:37.54,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,I said I was sorry, but he just can't seem to let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.19,0:03:39.54,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Such a child.{I'd probably still be pissed if someone hit me with a baseball bat. - L}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.93,0:03:44.65,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Is carrying that stuff here your job?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.65,0:03:47.30,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Just use your power. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.65,0:03:51.47,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Oh, it's not some fancy kind of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.47,0:03:54.33,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Yeah... I'd rather not say what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.33,0:03:55.31,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Oh hey, Nagara,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.61,0:03:58.25,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,wanna play a little baseball together again sometime?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.25,0:04:00.77,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's this coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.77,0:04:03.51,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,I have to practice once in a while, or I'll get rusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.51,0:04:05.19,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Come on, join me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.19,0:04:07.81,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Wow, this is a surprise. You were in the baseball club?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.81,0:04:09.15,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.15,0:04:11.95,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Are you for real? I'll never forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.95,0:04:13.31,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,During our last{ little league} tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.31,0:04:15.97,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,your three consecutive errors cost us the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.97,0:04:17.75,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I-Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:20.21,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,If it weren't for that, we could have gone to Nationals!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:24.49,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Hey, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.99,0:04:29.09,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Ace is around, right?\N Why don't you play with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.09,0:04:32.71,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,No can do. You know how much he hates to practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:35.93,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Besides, lately he's been too busy with his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.93,0:04:37.47,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, {\i1}her{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:40.73,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Must be nice to be popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.11,0:04:44.09,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Hey, any of you heard what Ace's power is?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.09,0:04:45.35,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.35,0:04:46.19,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.19,0:04:48.25,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Apparently it's "Sweetwater."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.25,0:04:49.77,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Huh? What does that do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.77,0:04:50.99,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Exactly that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.99,0:04:54.04,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Supposedly, he can make any water drinkable.{This girl is severely underestimating the severity of a looming water crisis}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.04,0:04:55.45,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,What a riot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.45,0:05:00.25,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,For all that big talk, he gets to drink muddy water and say it's yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.57,0:05:04.38,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Say, if you're asking for baseball practice,\N does that mean you have a place where you can play?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.77,0:05:08.37,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact,\N I made a baseball diamond not far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.37,0:05:09.85,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Whoa, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.85,0:05:10.83,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.83,0:05:12.01,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.64,0:05:23.14,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that, monkeys?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.91,0:05:29.73,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,That was awesome, transfer kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.73,0:05:30.15,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.43,0:05:33.24,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Nobody's beaten the Rock Monster since Steroid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.53,0:05:34.99,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Huh? Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.99,0:05:36.93,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Steroid Monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.93,0:05:39.74,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Eight-time record-setter for\N home runs in the Monkey League!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.09,0:05:42.12,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Wait, what's the Monkey League?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.12,0:05:44.59,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Huh? You don't know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.59,0:05:50.26,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Oh, right, you can't see them, huh? Sorry 'bout that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.53,0:05:54.01,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The Monkey League—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.39,0:05:57.27,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,It's a baseball league here in the world of Monkey Mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.27,0:06:00.64,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,played by the great monkeys,\N which started when the first ball and bat
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.64,0:06:04.14,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,and the rules of the game were handed down to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.71,0:06:10.25,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}In the Monkey League, a number of great players arose from among the nameless masses,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.25,0:06:12.71,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}who all bore the same appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.71,0:06:14.67,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}The legendary home run king,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.67,0:06:19.89,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}who hit an unprecedented, record-breaking 80 home runs in one year, Steroid Monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.89,0:06:23.07,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}Toppling the god of batting,\N Monkey River's career batting average
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:27.59,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}by two thousandths,\N the miracle hitting machine, Upper Monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.59,0:06:31.09,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}The greatest catcher of the Bigfoot era, Mister Monkey,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.09,0:06:34.91,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}who as a manager would go on to break the record for most league wins,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.91,0:06:37.43,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}with a legendary ten-season-long streak!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.43,0:06:40.43,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Then came the golden age of the M-League.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.43,0:06:44.13,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,A miracle monkey came along and dethroned those previous legends one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.13,0:06:46.65,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The monster, Monkey Blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.65,0:06:49.49,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,This maverick of the league was the only one with blue hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.49,0:06:52.59,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,who, despite weathering ugly\N discrimination and crafty persecution,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.59,0:06:56.33,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,triumphed with overwhelming talent,\N to ultimately become a hero,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:06:58.95,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,and a symbol of hope for the monkeys!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.39,0:07:02.47,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Despite being a rookie,\N Blue put the brakes to the king, Steroid Monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.47,0:07:05.29,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Breaking his bat along with his heart,\N Blue drove him to retirement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.29,0:07:09.27,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Then, with his mighty pitching arm, Blue led his underdog team Monkey and Club to victory,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.27,0:07:12.07,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,preventing Bigfoot's championship streak from reaching 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.07,0:07:14.29,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The public accepted this new hair color,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.29,0:07:16.15,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,and there was no doubt in anybody's mind
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.15,0:07:17.93,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,that the era of Monkey Blue had begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.93,0:07:18.97,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.25,0:07:22.69,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,a great tragedy shook the sport,\N when a near-perfect game was foiled,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.69,0:07:25.35,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,and a monkey was killed in the diamond!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.35,0:07:27.81,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,I wanna see them! I wanna see the monkeys!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.81,0:07:29.48,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Huh? {\i1}That's{\i0} your takeaway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.48,0:07:31.13,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,I want to see the monkeys, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.13,0:07:33.82,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,I know, right? Monkeys! Monkeys! I want my own pet monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.15,0:07:35.82,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Where can we see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.41,0:07:38.32,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.63,0:07:40.11,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Huh? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.11,0:07:41.59,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Like I said, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.59,0:07:43.41,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Uh, {\i1}here{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.41,0:07:45.47,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Yeah. Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.47,0:07:48.69,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,But it's not like you can just wait around and see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.69,0:07:51.33,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,You need to use a certain piece of gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.65,0:07:52.53,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Gear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.53,0:07:53.84,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,What kind of gear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.35,0:07:55.84,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Oh, the monkeys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.84,0:07:59.72,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,That's right. You have to use one of these to see the monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.37,0:08:02.60,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,A Monkey Getter. Wanna borrow it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.27,0:08:04.85,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.27,0:08:04.85,Alt Styling,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.15,0:08:07.85,Default,Shanghai,0,0,0,,[No! No way in hell!]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.41,0:08:12.98,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Hey, if money's the problem, I got you covered. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.31,0:08:16.61,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,It's not about the money. She just doesn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.61,0:08:21.11,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Damn her. If we had that thing,\N we could see the monkeys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.11,0:08:25.05,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,What do we do? Steal it?\N Threaten them? Beat them? Trick them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.05,0:08:26.33,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.33,0:08:27.79,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.79,0:08:31.25,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Hey, how do you all even know about the monkeys in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.87,0:08:35.85,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,We were helping Cap with some baseball practice,\N and he told us about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.85,0:08:36.67,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.67,0:08:37.71,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.71,0:08:39.61,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Can you really see monkeys with that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.61,0:08:41.63,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Huh? You don't believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.63,0:08:44.53,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,N-No, it's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.53,0:08:48.83,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,I get what you mean, though.\N It just looks like a regular flashlight, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.83,0:08:53.75,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,But if you shine it on yourself like this,\N you become able to see the monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.75,0:08:56.67,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Or maybe more precisely,\N the world where the monkeys live.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.67,0:08:57.99,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.99,0:09:00.73,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Then again, Nagara, for you, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.73,0:09:03.32,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Yeah, for old time's sake, as former teammates.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.69,0:09:04.82,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,You'll lend it to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.35,0:09:09.61,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,How does this sound?\N You've already got some practice in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.61,0:09:12.96,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Play against me, and if you win, I'll let you borrow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.21,0:09:15.21,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,A one-inning game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.77,0:09:20.05,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,If any of you get a hit off one of my pitches, you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.05,0:09:20.84,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.84,0:09:22.01,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.01,0:09:23.37,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,We'll play your game!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.09,0:09:26.10,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Heh, that's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:30.10,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,But I'm not playing for nothing.\N I want something in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.67,0:09:32.45,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,If {\i1}you{\i0} lose...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.77,0:09:38.98,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey, I don't know about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.98,0:09:40.99,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,It's settled!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.53,0:09:46.87,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Come on, you're not even close!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.33,0:09:49.37,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Stop dropping your elbow! Keep your head up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.13,0:09:55.91,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I've got no hope of hitting against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.91,0:09:57.75,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Well, you could be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.75,0:10:00.00,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Is Ace really that good?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.31,0:10:04.38,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's a prodigy.\N He's already had pros come asking about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.38,0:10:06.47,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? That is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.47,0:10:09.55,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Hey! What good is it if you're beaten before you even play?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.55,0:10:13.01,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Play to win! If you don't believe in yourself, who will?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.33,0:10:19.73,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I've never counted on myself for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.27,0:10:23.11,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.47,0:10:27.31,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Well, you never know what's going to happen during a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.31,0:10:29.37,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Hope for a miracle and do your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.67,0:10:33.45,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,By the way, what was his condition for doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.45,0:10:35.85,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing that important.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.23,0:10:41.63,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,You're not playing baseball with them?\N They'd have it in the bag with you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.63,0:10:43.63,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in seeing monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.63,0:10:45.51,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Plus that oaf is there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.51,0:10:49.51,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I'm terribly curious about this\N mysterious flashlight, the Monkey Getter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.03,0:10:54.02,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,If something like that exists,\N it could change my whole view of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.51,0:10:58.21,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Makes no difference to me.\N Once Nagara masters his power,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.21,0:10:59.97,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,we'll be home in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.15,0:11:03.78,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I don't think it's quite that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.78,0:11:09.49,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,That year had been Blue's greatest season.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.49,0:11:11.73,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Every game, he pitched the full nine innings and won.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.73,0:11:15.91,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,With a league-high 32 wins posted,\N the team won its second consecutive title.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.91,0:11:17.97,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Then, in the final game of the season,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.97,0:11:22.05,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Blue was closing in on pitching an absolutely perfect game!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.57,0:11:23.71,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,It was 16-0,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.71,0:11:27.01,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,with Monkey and Club commanding a huge lead going into the final inning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.01,0:11:31.63,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Bottom of the 9th, two outs.\N Blue had struck out 26 batters on 80 pitches,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.63,0:11:34.73,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,and had gotten the last batter two strikes down in quick order!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.73,0:11:40.17,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The overflowing stadium was blanketed in electricity,\N waiting for the call of that last pitch to ring out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.17,0:11:45.23,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,All of the monkeys there focused their intense gaze on Blue's every move!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.23,0:11:49.70,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,None of them had any doubt that this would be an absolutely perfect game!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.70,0:11:52.79,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Yes, there was indeed an uneasy foreboding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.79,0:11:56.69,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,In hindsight, it was clear.\N One monkey, unaccustomed to that pressure—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.69,0:11:58.25,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,the peculiar umpire...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.86,0:12:01.25,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Then, the world went off-kilter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.25,0:12:04.67,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The 81st pitch! Out of respect for Blue's honor,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.67,0:12:06.77,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,I will say that it was by no means a careless pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.77,0:12:08.51,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The world itself had slipped!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.79,0:12:11.83,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,No, there is no possibility that I'm being partial to Blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.83,0:12:13.39,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,It actually happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.39,0:12:18.03,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The world itself moved just a little bit! It's the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.19,0:12:23.55,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The ball looked like it may have slightly missed the strike zone,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.55,0:12:26.15,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,but could be called as either a strike or a ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.15,0:12:29.17,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,And the umpire making the call was the one monkey in that stadium—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.17,0:12:32.95,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,in that whole world—who did slip with the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.57,0:12:40.59,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The crowd rose to their feet en masse!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.59,0:12:42.15,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,They started tearing out their hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.15,0:12:44.03,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,and stamping their feet with all their might!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.03,0:12:46.37,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,They broke out in boos! Tremendous booing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.37,0:12:48.92,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The umpire firmly refused requests to check the video replay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.25,0:12:51.69,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Blue was visibly dissatisfied, and charged the umpire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.69,0:12:52.93,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,"That was a strike!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.57,0:12:55.57,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The umpire quietly shook his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.57,0:12:56.79,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,"Hey, are you nuts?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.79,0:13:00.13,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,That pitch would have sealed an absolutely perfect game!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.13,0:13:02.77,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The umpire firmly replied, "I am aware."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.77,0:13:06.63,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,"No, you don't get it!\N Why didn't you call that ball a strike?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.63,0:13:08.77,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The outcome of the game is already decided!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.77,0:13:12.51,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,On top of that, this game is a throwaway anyhow!\N The batter is dispirited!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.51,0:13:16.29,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,So how come, when it didn't matter if you called that pitch a strike or a ball,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.29,0:13:19.91,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,did you not call it a strike?! What was the point of that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.91,0:13:23.99,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Moreover, do you not hear the cheers of hope and anticipation from the crowd?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.99,0:13:27.96,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,You know that this isn't the outcome they wanted!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.33,0:13:30.47,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,"I am aware of that, as well."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.45,0:13:32.88,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,So, why did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.23,0:13:36.89,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,"The hopes of the crowd have no bearing on this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.89,0:13:39.59,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,There is a stadium here, and inside it, there are rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.59,0:13:42.89,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,No matter what the reasons may be, things should remain fair in here."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.09,0:13:45.15,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,"You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.43,0:13:50.03,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,This is a baseball show!\N Everyone is pinning their hopes and dreams on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:53.09,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,I'm carrying the weight of the whole Monkey League!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.09,0:13:55.41,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Right now, as far as this place goes, {\i1}I{\i0} am the rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.49,0:13:58.21,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Now, reverse your decision!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.21,0:14:01.09,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Blue's huge hands were trembling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.09,0:14:02.66,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,"I cannot do that."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.23,0:14:05.25,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The umpire was utterly unflinching.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.25,0:14:08.42,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,"Right now, as far as this place is concerned, {\i1}I{\i0} am the rules."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.99,0:14:13.80,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Blue knew the truth as well.\N The replay was shown on the big screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.55,0:14:17.01,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,The fact was, due to the world slipping,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.01,0:14:20.81,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,the ball had missed the strike zone by no more than a micron!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.81,0:14:24.81,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,But Blue could not accept that decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.27,0:14:28.47,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,When play resumed,\N Blue threw the ball at the exact same speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.47,0:14:33.15,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,on the exact same course as that 81st pitch,\N three more times.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.15,0:14:34.82,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,"Ball four!"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.23,0:14:38.05,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Spiking his glove into the mound, Blue walked off the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.05,0:14:41.25,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,This incited the stirred-up spectators to begin rioting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.25,0:14:45.33,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,As the crowd rushed onto the field, they all charged at the umpire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.35,0:14:49.69,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,As the terrified batter looked on,\N the umpire had his head beaten in,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.69,0:14:53.09,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,and the rioting crowd tore him apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.09,0:14:56.67,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,His thin, scruffy body had its flesh and blood trodden on,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.67,0:14:59.71,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,spat upon, dishonored, and breathed its last.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.39,0:15:06.35,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,The monkey died.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.71,0:15:08.39,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,All over a game of baseball.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.11,0:15:13.07,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Blue had taken on all of their hopes for that one pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.07,0:15:14.59,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,What an amazing monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.59,0:15:17.86,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,That's for sure. Blue was the best pitcher ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.86,0:15:19.74,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,No, I meant the umpire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.05,0:15:20.85,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.75,0:15:25.12,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,He prevailed against the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.43,0:15:27.01,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,You're making too much of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.01,0:15:29.15,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Nagara, don't you feel anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.13,0:15:32.00,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Don't you feel angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.99,0:15:37.25,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.41,0:15:47.35,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Strike! Batter out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.10,0:15:51.73,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,It makes sense that that monkey got killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.57,0:15:54.72,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,A world where the ordinary kill the genius,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.72,0:15:57.74,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,or where ignorant fools destroy talent is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.95,0:16:01.49,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Foul!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:06.65,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,{\i1}With that rugged, yet beautiful form,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.65,0:16:09.75,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,{\i1}she'll never even see my lightning fastball.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.39,0:16:13.63,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Strike two!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.93,0:16:19.34,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Strike! Batter out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.19,0:16:23.33,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.75,0:16:29.33,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.49,0:16:39.55,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Strike two!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.55,0:16:44.12,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,So, how do you like my pitching?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.55,0:16:48.43,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're really good.\N I doubt there's any way I can hit that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.43,0:16:50.12,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,You just don't feel like hitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.03,0:16:52.33,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,There's no way I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.99,0:17:00.61,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Why am I not...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.53,0:17:04.09,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,B-Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.09,0:17:05.75,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Hey, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.75,0:17:08.87,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah! That was a beanball! Eject him!{I'm so glad this TL knows baseball. - L}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.87,0:17:10.31,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,He is so lame!{TLC}{Huh?}{Can be read as "damn he's bad" too tbh}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.31,0:17:11.98,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,He is handsome, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.98,0:17:13.27,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Hey, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.27,0:17:16.48,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,I'm the one who gave baseball to the monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.63,0:17:21.24,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,I am special.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.83,0:17:24.35,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,If you lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.35,0:17:27.89,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,then you return us to our world as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.89,0:17:32.50,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,You can't tell me you can't do it, either.\N I heard. You're our "savior", right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.11,0:17:35.67,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh? No, I'm not—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.67,0:17:38.69,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Just looking at you now makes me want to puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.69,0:17:41.35,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,I can't believe someone like you got chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.13,0:17:45.31,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,This world is all messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.31,0:17:48.57,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Put us back in the world where I am properly appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.57,0:17:50.99,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,That's what your power is for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.89,0:17:53.52,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.99,0:17:56.40,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Do it. Even if it kills you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.75,0:18:01.15,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh? A m-monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.19,0:18:05.03,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,A one-armed monkey...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.17,0:18:10.04,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,How did you know he had one arm?\N Can you see the umpire?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.39,0:18:25.75,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,The truth is, you wanted to be a baseball player, too, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.75,0:18:27.81,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,But you couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.11,0:18:33.89,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Still, you were drawn to the sometimes cruel fairness of baseball,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.89,0:18:35.55,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,and became an umpire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.01,0:18:41.59,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,You were watching over the game from there, this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.83,0:18:46.17,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,It wasn't the umpire that got killed...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.17,0:18:46.91,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.91,0:18:48.79,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,It was baseball!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.79,0:18:50.17,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you talking—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.17,0:18:51.37,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I saw it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.13,0:18:55.37,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,So he {\i1}can{\i0} do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.43,0:18:57.51,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,You scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.51,0:18:58.88,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,Don't get so full of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.13,0:19:01.38,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.13,0:19:05.38,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.39,0:19:11.89,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Strike! Batter out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.89,0:19:14.02,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Ah, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.27,0:19:17.73,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,That was awesome, Nagara!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.73,0:19:18.97,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,I underestimated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.97,0:19:22.31,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Too bad. But that was a nice swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.31,0:19:22.98,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.27,0:19:26.11,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Aw, we don't get to see any monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.11,0:19:26.97,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.97,0:19:28.05,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.05,0:19:30.45,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Huh? You've got something stuck to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.91,0:19:32.05,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.05,0:19:33.20,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.20,0:19:34.65,Overlap,Mizuho,0,0,0,,{\an8}That didn't come from my cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.65,0:19:35.87,Overlap,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}Is it some kind of fur?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.87,0:19:37.41,Overlap,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}When did it get stuck to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.49,0:19:39.46,Default,Ace,0,0,0,,You're here to cheer me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.91,0:19:42.19,Default,Shanghai,0,0,0,,[This isn't where we're supposed to be.]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.43,0:19:46.22,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,I guess today's the last day of life on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.22,0:19:47.99,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,I'm going to miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.99,0:19:49.71,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.23,0:19:55.07,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Actually, I've been thinking of quitting baseball for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.60,0:20:01.23,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Nobody knows better than me that\N I lack the talent to play in the big leagues.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.59,0:20:06.59,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Still, we played for the fun of it a long time ago. Just like monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.59,0:20:10.83,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,But before we knew it,\N it became about whether or not we had the talent,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.83,0:20:12.57,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,or how it would get us into college,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.57,0:20:16.03,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,and that started taking up all our attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.65,0:20:21.63,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,But then, watching those monkeys playing,\N I couldn't sit still.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.11,0:20:25.91,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}I don't know how to say it, but it was kind of like...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.91,0:20:29.15,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}I felt like, "I wanna play baseball!"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.15,0:20:33.29,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}And once I realized that, here it was—\Nthe diamond was already in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.29,0:20:35.89,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}Strange, isn't it? I don't have the talent for baseball,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.89,0:20:38.51,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,{\an8}but it's all I ever think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.65,0:20:42.07,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's not so strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.13,0:20:44.61,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,It's not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.61,0:20:46.07,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.41,0:20:53.74,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.74,0:20:55.97,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Does the plan seem like it's going to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.97,0:20:58.89,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Who knows? But it sure is an amazing power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.89,0:21:00.43,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,We can go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.43,0:21:03.59,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Really? It doesn't look that way to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.59,0:21:04.63,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,She's not lying...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.63,0:21:08.27,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,but it also may not be exactly what everyone is thinking, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.49,0:21:13.13,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Nagara has reached the point where he can control his warp power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.13,0:21:15.26,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,We can say goodbye to this place now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.61,0:21:18.04,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go home to our own world!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.85,0:21:22.47,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Go on, do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.97,0:21:24.79,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.03,0:21:33.66,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Huh? Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.66,0:21:35.89,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Oh, this isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.11,0:21:39.67,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,This isn't it, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.19,0:21:52.85,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Where's the school, already?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.85,0:21:54.71,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,How long until we get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.71,0:21:56.53,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,That's enough showing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.53,0:21:58.47,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.67,0:22:00.93,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I can't go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.93,0:22:01.99,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.99,0:22:04.19,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Not just to our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.19,0:22:06.94,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I can't go where I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.53,0:22:10.44,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,That guy really is worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.44,0:22:12.44,Overlap,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}Aww, are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.44,0:22:13.21,Alt Overlap,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}Well, that sucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.44,0:22:14.45,Overlap,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's about what I figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.21,0:22:14.45,Alt Overlap,Classmates,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's our fault for expecting anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.45,0:22:16.81,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,That pretty well clears that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.81,0:22:20.83,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Nagara has the power to move to other worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.31,0:22:23.45,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,But he can't choose where he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.45,0:22:28.31,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,I mean, I can't believe this world we've been in is one that he would choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.43,0:22:33.22,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Hey, look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.21,0:22:39.05,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Huh? M-Ms. Aki?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.72,0:22:40.59,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,A teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.59,0:22:43.23,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Someone else besides us got cast away?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.11,0:22:43.23,Alt Styling,Classmates,0,0,0,,She's here to save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.23,0:22:45.69,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Shut up, you worms!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.23,0:22:58.61,Default,Ms. Aki,0,0,0,,Playtime's over.
